@startuml "Template Method - Pattern - Class Diagram"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title GoF's Application and Document, in a short form

abstract class Application {
  ~ openDocument(fileName)
  ~ {abstract} canOpenDocument(fileName) : boolean
  ~ {abstract} createDocument(fileName) : Document
  ~ addDocument(Document)
}
abstract class Document {
  ~ {abstract} open()
  ~ {abstract} read()
  ~ {abstract} save()
  ~ {abstract} close()
}
class MyApplication
class MyDocument

Application <|-- MyApplication
Document <|-- MyDocument
Application o--> "*" Document
MyApplication ..> MyDocument : creates

note right of Application
  <b>openDocument() is the template method.</b>
  The full version, with the hook and the
  final keyword, is in the gof package.
end note
@enduml
